  "goodToKnow": "Kompatibel means compatible, mostly technically: kompatible Software, abwärtskompatibel (backward compatible). The EU made USB-C the standard charger for phones from the end of 2024, ending many Kompatibilität problems. Like flexibel, it drops its e with endings: kompatible Geräte. The native synonym, especially for ideas, is vereinbar: Beruf und Familie vereinbaren."
